hoven seinerseits für Richard Wagner, Glenn Gould oder Aldous Huxley? In charmanten wie kenntnisreichen Porträts erschließt Geck die Leitbilder Beethovens, seine Zeitgenossen und Nachfahren – und erklärt so seine ungebrochene Strahlkraft. Mit zahlreichen Abbildungen.","displaySummary":"In charmanten wie kenntnisreichen Porträts erschließt Geck die Leitbilder Beethovens, seine Zeitgenossen und Nachfahren – und erklärt so seine ungebrochene Strahlkraft. Mit zahlreichen Abbildungen.","primarySubject":"War & Military","primaryTopic":"War & Military Strategy","subjectEvidence":{"primarySubject":"War & Military","confidence":"low","method":"evidence_score","candidates":[{"subject":"War & Military","score":4,"evidenceCount":2}],"evidence":[{"source":"keyword_classifier","rawLabel":"War & Military","mappedSubject":"War & Military","score":2,"confidence":"low","note":"history keyword or history prize; war/military keyword","id":"subject-evidence-book-beethoven-der-schopfer-und-sein-universum-martin-geck-2"},{"source":"topic_classifier","rawLabel":"War & Military Strategy","mappedSubject":"War & Military","score":2,"confidence":"low","note":"war/military keyword; subject fallback","id":"subject-evidence-book-beethoven-der-schopfer-und-sein-universum-martin-geck-3"},{"source":"award_category","rawLabel":"Leipzig Book Fair Prize — Nonfiction/Essay","mappedSubject":"General Nonfiction","score":1,"confidence":"low","sourceId":"source-award-record-leipzig-nonfiction-wikipedia-preis-der-leipziger-buchmesse-sachbuch-essayistik","id":"subject-evidence-book-beethoven-der-schopfer-und-sein-universum-martin-geck-1"}]},"relatedBookIds":["book-balkan-odyssee-1933-1941-auf-der-flucht-vor-hitler-durch-sudosteuropa-marie-janine-calic","book-georg-forster-zwischen-freiheit-und-naturgewalt-jurgen-goldstein","book-krebs-fuhlen-eine-emotionsgeschichte-des-20-jahrhunderts-bettina-hitzer","book-wolfszeit-deutschland-und-die-deutschen-1945-1955-harald-jahner","book-anstandig-essen-ein-selbstversuch